# 📊 Read Repair vs Anti-Entropy vs Quorum

| Technique | Purpose |
|------------|----------|
| Read Repair | Fix stale replica during reads |
| Anti-Entropy | Background synchronization |
| Quorum | Increase probability of reading latest data |
| Hinted Handoff | Move temporary writes back to original replica |

