# 🔥 Golden Interview Takeaway

> **Leaderless Replication ka goal "Availability" hai, Strong Consistency nahi.**  
> **Quorum (`W + R > N`) latest data milne ki probability ko bahut improve karta hai kyunki Read aur Write replicas overlap karte hain, lekin race conditions, network partitions aur concurrent writes ki wajah se Strong Consistency ki guarantee nahi milti. Agar application ko 100% correct aur globally agreed state chahiye (Banking, Payments, etc.), to Leaderless Replication + Quorum kaafi nahi hote—waha **Distributed Consensus (Raft/Paxos)** ki zarurat padti hai.